{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beer Onsen Resort Demo</strong> is a free, self-contained preview of the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In this demo you can:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combine</strong> raw ingredients (hops, grains, spices, special botanicals) to create beer recipes (6 recipes are in this demo to explore).<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736170/extras/Brew.gif?t=1747977239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Serve</strong> the beer-infused springs to visiting spirits and earn not only the base fee but also tips granted for matching flavors.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736170/extras/Customer.gif?t=1747977239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock</strong> various ingredients through a lovely gacha machine.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736170/extras/gacha.gif?t=1747977239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All gameplay takes place at your own pace. There are no timers, no combat, and no hidden objectives\u2014just brewing, infusing, serving, and learning spirit reactions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are you ready to craft the ultimate haven for weary souls?</strong> Build your legacy\u2014one brew, one soak, and one satisfied spirit at a time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736170?t=1747977239","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736170?t=1747977239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736170/58e126e7337b7e0ed57544d6698b611c8b5666db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747977239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736170/58e126e7337b7e0ed57544d6698b611c8b5666db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747977239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beer Onsen Resort Demo</strong> is a free, self-contained preview of the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In this demo you can:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combine</strong> raw ingredients (hops, grains, spices, special botanicals) to create beer recipes (6 recipes are in this demo to explore).<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736170/extras/Brew.gif?t=1747977239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Serve</strong> the beer-infused springs to visiting spirits and earn not only the base fee but also tips granted for matching flavors.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736170/extras/Customer.gif?t=1747977239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock</strong> various ingredients through a lovely gacha machine.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736170/extras/gacha.gif?t=1747977239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All gameplay takes place at your own pace. There are no timers, no combat, and no hidden objectives\u2014just brewing, infusing, serving, and learning spirit reactions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are you ready to craft the ultimate haven for weary souls?</strong> Build your legacy\u2014one brew, one soak, and one satisfied spirit at a time.</p>","developers":["Green Tea Bee Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3683800","name":"Beer Onsen Resort"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736170/344e5a9c8c84f944ab031d6310607d09ca81885a/header.jpg?t=1747977239","is